{"seq":3,"slug":"advanced","title":"进阶","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/advanced","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bounded-loads","title":"有界负载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/advanced/bounded-loads","wordCount":1454,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"jump-hash","title":"Jump 哈希","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/advanced/jump-hash","wordCount":1479,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"weighted-distribution","title":"加权分布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/advanced/weighted-distribution","wordCount":1613,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"进阶\">进阶</h1><p>核心技术解决了「节点变动时少搬数据」，但留下了三个没完全解决的现实问题：热点、性能、异构。这一章的三篇分别对症下药。</p>\n<p>第一个问题是热点。即便配了虚拟节点，环上的负载方差依然存在，更糟的是某些键本身就是热门键，会把所属节点压垮。有界负载给每个节点设一个容量上限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>平均负载</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1+\\varepsilon)\\cdot \\text{平均负载}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平均负载</span></span></span></span></span></span>，键落到满载节点时顺延到下一个，从而给负载加了一道硬天花板。这是被 Google Cloud Pub/Sub 和 Vimeo 的 HAProxy 真正用在生产里的方案。</p>\n<p>第二个问题是性能与内存。哈希环要维护一棵有序结构，Rendezvous 查找是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。Jump 哈希反其道而行：零存储、五行代码、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\ln n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">ln</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 时间，均衡性近乎完美。代价是它只能处理「顺序编号、只在末尾增删」的节点集合，因此适合分片数固定增长的存储，不适合随机宕机的缓存集群。</p>\n<p>第三个问题是异构。真实集群里机器配置参差不齐，强机应当多分担。加权分布把「容量权重」统一引入环、虚拟节点、Rendezvous、Jump 各方案，让分配比例正比于权重。</p>\n<p>这三篇都建立在核心技术之上：有界负载补的是环，Jump 是环之外的另一条路，加权则横跨所有方案。读时请随时回看核心技术章的对应基础。读完即可进入工程实践，把这些算法装进真实系统。</p>\n"}